+- **Security Engineer (sec-eng)**: APPROVED (Board #118, #170)
+- **Systems/Backend Architect (arch-reviewer)**: APPROVED (Board #116, #167)
+- **Test & Build Quality Engineer (qa-eng)**: APPROVED (Board #120, #178)
